<p>Net income		$138	     $108	     $702</p>
<p>The Company's first quarter 1997 primary and fully diluted earnings per Class A Common Share were less than $0.01 compared to $0.01 and less than $0.01, respectively, for the same period in 1996.  The decline in the primary earnings per Class A Common Share resulted from an increase in the average Class A Common Shares outstanding to 28,775,995 for the first quarter of 1997 compared to 5,765,978 for the same period in 1996.  The Company's fully diluted average Class A Common Shares outstanding were 28,775,995 for the first quarter of 1997 compared to 18,458,925 for the same period in 1996.</p>
